WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:05.190
Speaker 1: It's quite stunning, but not altogether
surprising how quickly the perspectives on

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:13.349
presidents present and former having classified
documents has changed given the recent news

00:00:13.349 --> 00:00:14.580
about Joe Biden.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:19.170
As a reminder for all the people emailing
me saying, David, why won't you talk about

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.140
the Joe Biden classified documents?

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:23.859
We've talked about it so many times at this
point.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:27.250
Investigate Biden, figure out what happened,
figure out if there was wrongdoing.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.949
But it is a totally separate case from that
of Trump.

00:00:29.949 --> 00:00:34.500
And it doesn't mean you stop investigating
Trump because you're investigating Joe Biden

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:41.840
for a while when it was Donald Trump who had
directed staff to take hundreds of classified

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:46.820
documents to his house, who tried to use lawyers
to prevent giving them back, who had his lawyers

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.970
say we gave them back even though they didn't
give them back.

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:55.180
And everything that led up to the search warrant
being executed at Mar a Lago during all of

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.210
that time.

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.730
Right wingers were saying, this is a witch
hunt.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.609
This is a paperwork issue, this is a non-story.

00:01:01.609 --> 00:01:04.100
This is just something that happens and you
just deal with it.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.320
And the documents you give back and then you
just move on.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:11.619
You don't do all of this crazy stuff, including
showing up at Trump's house at Mar a Lago.

00:01:11.619 --> 00:01:17.630
But now all of a sudden that it's Joe Biden
being investigated for something similar,

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.810
but not at all the same thing.

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:22.579
All of a sudden now they're talking about
treason.

00:01:22.579 --> 00:01:24.079
That is not an exaggeration.

00:01:24.079 --> 00:01:26.360
In this clip, I'm going to play for you.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:31.270
Fox News host and perpetual Trump brown noser.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:38.060
Maria BARTIROMO asks James Comer, Congressman,
is this treason?

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.799
And even Colmer isn't ready to go that far
yet.

00:01:40.799 --> 00:01:41.799
Take a look.

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:45.469
Speaker 2: We need to know now who had access
to those documents because our national security

00:01:45.469 --> 00:01:46.469
could be at risk.

00:01:46.469 --> 00:01:50.310
Speaker 3: Well, I this is is this treason?

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:54.229
Speaker 2: It's it's very concerning.

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:55.260
We're not going to let up.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:59.310
I think that we've got plenty of information
to move forward.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.829
This would be a lot easier if the White House
would work with us.

00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:07.170
Not only are they stonewalling our investigation,
you know, they're constantly if you watch

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:13.230
that press conference with the NSA guy, they
brought in that to fight back against the

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.360
investigators, which is preposterous because
this is the oversight committee.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.580
We're supposed to provide oversight to the
government in the executive branch.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:20.690
You know, it's nothing but much worse.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.920
They need to slurs.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.710
The American people can see through this.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.190
The media is starting to see CNN TV.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.080
Speaker 1: And the music is coming up very
quickly there.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:33.489
So was Maria BARTIROMO asking whether it was
treason when it was Trump with hundreds of

00:02:33.489 --> 00:02:35.840
documents after months of trying to keep them?

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:36.840
Right.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:43.220
And I want you to think really, really carefully
about this, Biden having a small number of

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:49.520
documents left behind from when he was vice
president, which he didn't direct anyone to

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:55.860
take, which his lawyers found and immediately
called the National Archives and told them,

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.860
here's what we found.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:03.390
We want to get it back to you and fully cooperating
with an investigation that might be treason.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:09.940
On the other hand, Trump deliberately taking
hundreds of documents to his house, using

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:14.890
lawyers to obstruct the investigation, not
turning them over.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:17.659
That is, of course, a witch hunt or something.

00:03:17.659 --> 00:03:21.620
The double standard is breathtaking.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.159
Breathtaking.

00:03:23.159 --> 00:03:25.860
But it is not altogether surprising.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:31.870
And I will again, I know people love to write
in and say, David, you're so biased on a lot

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:34.540
of the I am on the left.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:42.020
Without a doubt, my views on issues when it
comes to taxation and the climate and education,

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:45.530
my views are on the left, there's no doubt
about it.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.640
But I make every effort not to play these
games with you because actually, unlike the

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.440
Fox audience, which doesn't respect their
audience and is like, my audience is stupid,

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:57.239
will, they'll fall for anything we say, I
actually respect you.

00:03:57.239 --> 00:03:59.920
And so I don't play the debt deficit games.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.909
I don't play the gas price games.

00:04:01.909 --> 00:04:04.030
And those parties, I don't do it.

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:10.530
And with this issue, I have said there are
some relevant, important differences between

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.970
the Trump and Biden classified documents situations.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:19.579
Regardless, those differences should come
out in investigations that take place into

00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:20.639
both of them.

00:04:20.639 --> 00:05:30.129
So don't play those games with me.

